<title>Eastern DR Congo: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/drc/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-drc-2026-10-19T11:00:49.170Z</guid>
<pubDate>Mon, 19 Oct 2026 11:00:49 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Joseph Kabila has formally allied with the M23 rebels, creating a coalition that is now attacking the Congolese army in North Kivu. Security personnel linked to Erik Prince were ambushed, resulting in the death of a former New Zealand special forces officer and the wounding of former UFC fighter Tim Kennedy. In Ituri, suspected ADF rebels killed 77 civilians. A former Congolese president has taken over a new rebel coalition. The conflict remains deadly, with 1,158 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipgFBVV95cUxOd1QtYS0yV2hvSXgzcHVwZzF2MFRIVjUzamZhNVZjRXB1TmczS2pHeEpjdlJQVS0tY2YxdjBQQ1JTMTJqZldSaFBOZUtZOWt2TFpNRnJPRlJjQ1lpTHp1VVJCM212b0U4TlV3RkVsNTFRaFdweV9rbWRJVE16dGl6OUJuQmZJUnRXcERsMUxKUF9pWXZSRldPQlZ0TXR1X2Q1QkU1NE9B?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Outlook India&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMic0FVX3lxTFBpSV9yTktpc1JOMC0zemtNUGk1c2cwYzF3cUQtRHM0MjFWRE5weDBMbHM0WlEtM283bXY4SGNjaGw1aTFDR1RJc3doZHVjWjg5Zjh6SFUtYlZzSlZqaGJFVjBWb1U5NmlzRVVScVJMZHJ3RFU?oc=5&quot;&gt;Open Doors UK &amp;amp; Ireland&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;NZ Herald&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMigAFBVV95cUxNdlVXaEI4VzhkOE9JdDZ1ZnJjQmJyN0xCcmxLSDJyd3JaNDI2Skt2UkdKTGtoOXdTYzM3dk5fQTFoMFJYaVU1SkRhdHpfVEhHT1JVcWd2Z3pfNFc0bVR4aVpyTDdkR0tWUERTTmtYV1NINlhKeDBpVnFVOGY1UWhzRw?oc=5&quot;&gt;UG Diplomat&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxOXzFhc05ZbjVsc3phTWhkbDJObkhWWnlzQXIwemFzblZhLV92NVR6TExfMmMwX3oxNVNFUUg0SlE4bTlQUUsxcnpEd2pGNEE2U1ZzT245Q2tRbDFPWFItM3hfalVPdDlxZXBtTG9HRW5fUGVKYmVka2tyZU9tSU9TdXprM3RYOEhTT1Y5a0ZNUUI2dDNTX21NcENRVTU?oc=5&quot;&gt;UG Diplomat&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;